{"tool_name":"roi-1-click-tools-for-imagejfiji","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This macro toolset offers additional click tools for the rapid annotations of ROI in ImageJ/Fiji.</p>\n\n<p>The ROI 1-click tools can be setup with a predefined shape, and custom actions to perform upon click (Add to ROI Manager, Run Measure, Go to next slice, run a macro command...)</p>\n\n<p>To install in Fiji, just activate the ROI 1-click tools&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This macro toolset offers additional click tools for the rapid annotations of ROI in ImageJ/Fiji.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The ROI 1-click tools can be setup with a predefined shape, and custom actions to perform upon click (Add to ROI Manager, Run Measure, Go to next slice, run a macro command...)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To install in Fiji, just activate the ROI 1-click tools&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-10-19T14:48:24+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-03-30T09:00:17+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1585559800,"last_comment_uid":3113,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Thomas Laurent orcid.org/0000-0001-7686-3249"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"YouTube tutorial","uri":"https://youtu.be/ZPS78T_-gUs"}],"has_doi":[{"options":[],"title":"DOI","uri":"https://doi.org/10.17912/micropub.biology.000215"}],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4771,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0226","url":"/annotation"},{"target_id":4773,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3553","url":"/image-annotation"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_ter